{"reviewId": "276023870_86lMNSVFK", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "你（以及无数散户）认为，“经济不好，就要买龙头，买大公司，买行业老大，因为它们抗揍。”\n*   **残酷真相：** 在康波萧条期和工业化转型期（也就是现在），**大龙头 = 大包袱**。\n    *   它们的规模是基于旧时代的红利建立的（比如房地产繁荣期的家电龙头、基建繁荣期的工程机械龙头）。\n    *   当旧时代结束，巨大的产能瞬间变成巨大的负债。船大难掉头，它们根本无法转型。\n    *   **映射你的持仓：** 看看你手里那些“消费龙头”、“金融龙头”。这段话明确告诉你：**它们的价值十分有限**。它们只能横盘阴跌，消化估值。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11855-11936", "abstract": "其三，企业的规模经济问题，要探讨重组所带来的规模经济是否有价值。历史的情况是，在工业化转型期，相当多的产业还没到大规模集中的程度，所谓龙头企业的价值是十分有限的。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "276023870_86lMNSVFK", "userVid": 276023870, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769088049, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 276023870, "name": "耕心若溪", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJibQhvqnuGLLR8pAkWtibbs16LcLIwhz4klZ22YTLalWl20NvBS4AwmK7iaALL72OLCg7S6OaFfGtVArwaLsrvPq8OMoSHX7sPVriaqsSdOwndCg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "耕心若溪", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-B-6-6-1", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 27, "likes": [{"userVid": 75548880, "name": "涵Hanna", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/sIGHDlE3UCXtgJj68sUz9X9G1jXTEVs093Vx4JZCE4VIbNCsMDJjQQuAUr0ha2UGAPUeKy7Ks2s/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "涵Hanna", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signa